    "text": "After deep DOGE cuts, National Weather Service gets OK to fill up to 450 jobs\nBy ALEXA ST. JOHN,\n6 hours agoThe National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration will hire as many as 450 people to shore up the National Weather Service after deep cuts this spring raised concern about dangerous understaffing, the Trump administration confirmed Wednesday. NOAA was granted permission to fill critical positions at its weather arm, including openings for...",
